\pard\sb260\sa120\keepn\b\fs26\cf1 The project in 90 seconds\b0\cf0\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 **Goal:** Build an independently branded, robust, desktop-first and local-first download manager for authorized content, with a secure Chrome companion, later Firefox, local media processing and a modern website. Competitors are benchmarks for capabilities and user experience, not a verified ranking of \u8220?#1\u8221?.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 **Exactly two primary candidates (conditional; not yet imported):**\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 1. [AB Download Manager](https://github.com/amir1376/ab-download-manager) \u8212? Kotlin/Compose desktop; pinned research commit `68f0ea6e8ba5cbeb02c92342cd3bf7475378ae68`.\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 2. [AB Browser Integration](https://github.com/amir1376/ab-download-manager-browser-integration) \u8212? Chrome Manifest V3 and Firefox integration; pinned research commit `bf6811dd8a3ee2b47b94d70e13c2c7e70be7be05`.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 There are 15 additional study repositories. Study or selectively adapt them only after security, licensing, maintenance and duplication reviews. **One final product monorepo**, not an indiscriminate copy of 17 projects.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 **Historical implementation truth:** Initial documentation + an original Python HTTP/HTTPS deterministic fixture, regression tests and CI workflow. The last reported local fixture run passed **14 tests**; no integrated first-party desktop downloader, extension handoff, hosted service or release was yet built. Never confuse candidate upstream features with features actually implemented in this repo.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 **Known gates:** Owner approval for foundation/source import, original project licensing, Windows+Chrome initial scope; complete Gradle/JDK 25 environment check; upstream extension TypeScript repair; native-messaging/localhost authentication and pairing; 2 reported high-severity dependency advisories to triage; bundled third-party provenance.\par
\pard\sa80\par
