\pard\sb260\sa120\keepn\b\fs26\cf1 Working rules\b0\cf0\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - **Reuse verified, appropriately licensed implementations.** Do not spend time rebuilding existing queues, scheduling, browser handoff, FFmpeg, or installers without a demonstrated need.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - **Keep one product repository** with modular packages rather than pasting unrelated projects together.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - **Implement in verified increments.** Every feature needs tests, meaningful errors and a clear status.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - **Privacy and safety first.** Protect user files, download permissions, cookies, local helper APIs and cloud services.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - **Do not promise universal website support.** Compatibility changes, permissions and platform policies limit availability.\par
\pard\sa80\par
