\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - Preserve copyright, LICENSE and NOTICE requirements.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - GPL/AGPL code is not silently compatible with a proprietary product.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - FFmpeg licensing depends on actual binaries, codecs and build flags.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - Never copy logos, names, trademarks, proprietary assets or credentials.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - Do not bypass DRM, login, paywalls or site terms.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - Test only with user-owned or explicitly permitted download sources.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - Protect localhost APIs against unauthorized webpages and commands.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - No unsupported promises of universal or YouTube downloading.\par
