\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 For **each** adoption candidate:\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 1. Pin source URL, commit SHA/tag, commit date and maintainer status.\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 2. Read project license, CONTRIBUTING, NOTICE, third-party notices and build files.\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 3. Enumerate transitive dependency licenses, bundled executables and media codecs.\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 4. Identify known vulnerabilities, unsafe install scripts, open network listeners and insecure defaults.\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 5. Build from source in a clean environment and record exact command, OS, logs and artifacts.\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 6. Test relevant features with an authorized sample; verify what works instead of repeating README claims.\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 7. Estimate maintenance burden, compatibility and expected integration changes.\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 8. Record **reuse / adapt / reference only / reject**, with decision and reviewer.\par
