\pard\sb360\sa160\keepn\b\fs31\cf1 Product vision and strategy\b0\cf0\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sb260\sa120\keepn\b\fs26\cf1 Mission\b0\cf0\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 Create a leading independent **download management and authorized media-processing** system with the reliability of a professional desktop download manager, the convenience of a browser extension, and the approachable experience of a modern website. "No. 1" is an aspiration, **not an achieved ranking or verified market claim**.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sb260\sa120\keepn\b\fs26\cf1 Users and jobs\b0\cf0\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\f1\fs15\sa0 | User | Primary job | Product response |\par
\pard\f1\fs15\sa0 | --- | --- | --- |\par
\pard\f1\fs15\sa0 | Everyday desktop user | Save large permitted files without restarting after interruptions | Reliable queue, progress, resume, integrity checks |\par
\pard\f1\fs15\sa0 | Creator/editor | Convert and organize their own or licensed media | Local FFmpeg workflows, formats, metadata, subtitles |\par
\pard\f1\fs15\sa0 | Power user | Manage many legitimate downloads efficiently | Scheduling, batch intake, history, filtering, CLI/API later |\par
\pard\f1\fs15\sa0 | Browser-first user | Save downloadable files without switching context | Small, privacy-conscious browser companion |\par
\pard\f1\fs15\sa0 | Self-hosting user (later) | Manage their own permitted file-processing workflow remotely | Authenticated web UI and optional self-hosted service |\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sb260\sa120\keepn\b\fs26\cf1 Competitive benchmarks\b0\cf0\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - **4K Video Downloader Plus:** approachable desktop UX; presets, high-quality formats, subscriptions/playlists when authorized.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - **Internet Download Manager:** robust queueing, segmented transfers, resume/recovery and browser integration.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - **Video DownloadHelper:** discover permitted media from browser pages and provide understandable conversion choices.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - **JDownloader:** batch intake, automation and download management.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - **Cobalt:** simple web interaction and low-friction flows.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 These are **feature inspirations**, not permission to copy trademarks, designs, closed-source code or protected content. See [sources and scope](COMPETITOR_BENCHMARK.md).\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sb260\sa120\keepn\b\fs26\cf1 Differentiators to prove\b0\cf0\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 1. **Reliability:** recover cleanly from interruption and system restart.\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 2. **Local-first privacy:** prefer on-device downloading and media processing; clear disclosures when cloud services are used.\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 3. **One shared experience:** desktop, extension and website use a coherent job model and design language.\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 4. **Trust:** no misleading buttons, bundled adware, silent credential collection or opaque third-party uploads.\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 5. **Good defaults:** safe filenames, sensible format presets, helpful errors, minimal permissions.\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 6. **Developer-ready extensibility:** source adapters and API contracts can evolve independently.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sb260\sa120\keepn\b\fs26\cf1 Business and quality outcomes (targets, not results)\b0\cf0\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - First public beta: installable desktop application plus working extension for permitted direct downloads, with reproducible automated tests.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - Later product: responsive web UI, localized design, signed releases, auto-updates and supported conversion workflows.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - Measure: completion rate, interruption recovery, median support resolution, download integrity, install success, crash-free sessions and user retention.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - Do not promise universal site support, guaranteed acceleration multipliers, guaranteed 8K, DRM removal or Chrome Web Store approval.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sb260\sa120\keepn\b\fs26\cf1 Non-goals and boundaries\b0\cf0\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - No access-control, paywall, DRM, authentication or geo-block circumvention.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - No downloading copyrighted YouTube audiovisual media without YouTube permission/appropriate service authorization.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - No bulk hosting of third-party media as a default; minimize server bandwidth/storage costs.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - No rewriting established open-source infrastructure merely for novelty.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - No permanent product branding, license or pricing decision without owner confirmation.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\sb260\sa120\keepn\b\fs26\cf1 Product release ordering\b0\cf0\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 1. **Desktop + browser companion** for ordinary authorized file downloads.\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 2. **Optional local media processing** of uploaded/owned files, with tested format support.\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 3. **Website** and authenticated remote features where lawful and operationally sustainable.\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 4. **Advanced automation and integrations** only after reliability, security and license audits pass.\par
\pard\sa80\par
