\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - Runtime/debugging/telemetry behavior.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - Extension IDs, native messaging registration, endpoint binding and pairing.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - CI job links and release artifact provenance.\par
