\pard\sb360\sa160\keepn\b\fs31\cf1 M0 audit log \u8212? first engineering pass\b0\cf0\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 **Initial pass:** 13 November 2026. **Follow-up:** 15 November 2026.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 **Status:** IN PROGRESS \u8212? 17 study repositories triaged at pinned commits, both upstream extension bundles build, local Python fixture tests pass. No user-facing Downloader application has been imported or released.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 **Scope:** In-depth initial source audit of AB desktop/extension, targeted source investigation of 15 additional candidates, reproducible build probes, and original test fixture work. Full dependency licensing and third-party binary verification remain open.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 This log distinguishes **observed source/build evidence** from proposed feature work. It is intended to let a new developer or Codex agent resume without spending time rebuilding features upstream already supplies.\par
\pard\sa80\par
