\pard\sb190\sa100\keepn\b\fs23\cf1 Security decisions to preserve\b0\cf0\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - **High:** upstream AB `apiEnabled=true` but `apiAuthEnabled=false` by default; integration `/add` may skip key enforcement and can feed silent-import flow. The local bridge must authenticate and authorize job-creating requests; loopback binding does not suffice. Native messaging is preferred for the first slice (issue #6).\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - **High:** extension's broad `*://*/*`, cookies, webRequest, nativeMessaging and content-script access require privacy minimization and negative-origin tests before packaging.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - **Supply chain:** two high production-dependency advisories appeared in a pinned upstream npm audit. Preserve evidence and evaluate targeted upgrades without bypassing TypeScript checks.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - **Website:** ReClip's Flask backend runs submitted URLs via yt-dlp and keeps jobs in process memory. No adequate default hosted SSRF, authentication, quota or persistence guarantees were evident in inspected code; **reference its UX only**, pending an original safe design.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - **Licensing:** MediaGrabber's bundled Windows FFmpeg is identified as GPLv3 in its third-party notices; FFmpeg's LGPL/GPL behavior is build dependent. Gopeed, aria2, Cobalt, MeTube, Pinchflat, Tube Archivist and other GPL/AGPL examples are not silently importable into an unlicensed product.\par
\pard\li200\fi-100\fs19\sa35 - **Policy:** support user-owned/expressly permitted downloads, review browser-store requirements, and reject DRM/protected source circumvention. Do not promise general YouTube integration.\par
\pard\sa80\par
\pard\f0\fs19\sa70 **Open work:** exact transitive SBOM and NOTICE inventory, full desktop Java 25 + Gradle boot/build/tests, extension typecheck repair in an owner-approved fork, authentic Chrome/native handoff, user decisions G03\u8211?G06/G08, and platform policy review. All remain unchecked in the [implementation checklist](IMPLEMENTATION_CHECKLIST.md).\par
\pard\sa80\par
