\pard\f1\fs15\sa0 | 2 | [AB Browser Integration](https://github.com/amir1376/ab-download-manager-browser-integration) | TS/React/Vite, MV3 manifest, native + HTTP adapters, HLS interception; two bundler builds PASS, typecheck FAIL | Apache-2.0 LICENSE, package.json | **REUSE** primary extension. Maintain protocol compatibility with #1. |\par
